label scene24:
    scene bg campus
    # transforming the camera works too, but this resets when we say `scene` and camera doesn't
    show layer master at fx.flashback
    show kohei young neutral at right 
    show bart young neutral at center, flip
    show jojo young neutral at left, flip
    # show linda young neutral at right2
    # show fx_crt_scanlines

    # > 24       INT. AFTERNOON; CROWN ACADEMY DORMS.                                     24
    student1 "I heard Joseph Chen just got recognized for creating fast travel. Apparently it’s going to make flights between the earth and moon SUPER quick. Like hours, not days."
    student2 "I heard his two best friends are on completely opposite sides of this. Kohei Kitadani is supporting this discovery while Bartholemew Barthandelus says it’s against our religious teachings."
    student3 "Hey, if it means we get more time for vacation, then I’m all for it! I love technology!"

    kohei "Bart, you’ve GOT to let it go. I mean... I get it... We get it, you’re a church guy-"
    show bart young stern
    bart "Oh screw you, “church guy”, this is my entire life!"
    jojo "That’s not really... church like language..."
    ### page 45 ###
    show bart young worried at noflip
    bart "What I’m saying is... we’re getting closer to the end of days. All of these advancements.... our society isn’t meant to have such convenience."
    show kohei young confused
    kohei "I feel like... we got past this when we conquered the moon..."
    show bart at flip
    bart "The church has been saying that even THAT was a mistake!"
    show jojo young serious
    jojo "So you guys kind of just exist to halt progress."
    show bart young angry 2 at noflip, fx.hopN(n=1, y=75, stretch=(0.1,0.15))
    bart "BLASPHEMY!"
    show kohei young worried
    kohei "Honestly I never know when you’re being serious or putting on an act..."
    show bart young neutral
    bart "When did our ancestors invent holo- net?"
    show jojo young neutral
    jojo "Well back then they called it the internet, and it was somewhere around the second millennium."
    jojo "Like... the early 2000s. Maybe late 1900s?"
    kohei @ young neutral "And before that, they couldn’t talk to each other freely."
    kohei "Bart... what’s your point? The internet was a revolutionary step. Kind of goes against the idea that technology should be-"
    show bart young worried at flip
    bart "And in less than 50 years, the great cataclysm. The second fall of humanity."
    show bart young neutral
    bart "First the internet, then huge facilities that were killing the planet. Then reactors that destroyed the environment... The planet answered..."
    show kohei young confused
    kohei "And then the Angel from above blah blah blah I get it... but you see that part right there... that’s not an actual explanation, Bart."
    # > (MORE)
    ### page 46 ###
    show bart young sideeye
    kohei "The more realistic thing is war. They fought each other, and blew each other to smithereens."
    jojo "Nobody really knows."
    show bart young angry 1
    kohei "Right, but if we’re thinking LOGICALLY, which one are you going with? Humans humaning or an angelic terror from on high? Come on now..."
    # > Holo-time ringtone
    # play sound sfx_pururin_ringtone
    pause 2
    show kohei young kyaa
    show jojo young sad
    show bart young peaceful
    pause 1
    jojo "Ah the girlfriend."
    stop sound
    show kohei young happy
    pause 0
    show linda young happy 2 holo at right2, flip
    with dissolve
    bart "If there’s one thing Kohei loves more than blasphemy it’s Linda."
    show kohei young happy
    kohei "Heyyyyy girlfriend!"
    define l = linda_young
    l "Heyyyyy boyfriend! Look!"
    show kohei young kyaa
    kohei "AAAAAAAAHHHH IT’S SO CUTE!"
    show linda young kyaa holo
    l "I KNOW RIGHT!? AAAAAAAAH!!!"
    show jojo young crying focus at noflip
    show bart young happy
    bart "Guys... you two should just get married already."
